# Casa Lumen — Design & Security

alwaysApply: true

These rules apply in every file and every prompt.

## Visual prohibitions

Never:
- Hero fullscreen text centered + gradient button
- Three columns with icons (benefits pattern)
- Auto-carousel
- "Trusted by" logos
- White testimonial cards with star emojis
- Navbar with huge search + gray mega-menu
- Product cards with shadow + blue "Add to cart"

Use only:
- Editorial grid (7 cols content + 5 cols text, asymmetric)
- Mono SKU numbers (CL-SOF-220, tracking 0.08em)
- Display typography (Fraunces, 64–112px desktop, -0.03em tracking)
- Fixed header 64px, paper bg 92% + blur
- Fillet separators (--line color)

## Security prohibitions

Never:
- Mark `orders.status = paid` without webhook signature
- Put `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` on `NEXT_PUBLIC_`
- Disable RLS or trust `localStorage` roles
- Use `any` or `@ts-ignore`
- Calculate prices in browser only
- Store card data
- Generate fake XML/PDF invoices

## Required

- All amounts in centavos (integers), half-away-from-zero rounding
- Shipping free >= 15,000 MXN; Michoacán 249 / rest of MX 399
- IVA 16%, shown as included
- Payment Brick (no card capture on server)
- CFDI 4.0 with Facturapi SDK
- Webhooks verified by signature
- Admin auth checked server-side
- RLS on all tables
